flowchart LR
    User["Presenter / browser"]
    Model["Optional Ollama endpoint<br/>Not deployed by this demo"]

    subgraph GKE["KSUG.AI demo · GKE Standard · one worker node"]
        direction TB
        subgraph AppNS["Namespace: velero-demo"]
            App["KSUG.AI Aurora AI<br/>Document Q&A UI + API"]
            Docs[("Document PVC<br/>Uploaded files + recovery checkpoint")]
            DB["PostgreSQL<br/>Document catalog + conversations<br/>Live PGDATA is ephemeral"]
            Dump[("Backup PVC<br/>Logical database dump")]
            App -->|Read / write files| Docs
            App -->|Read / write metadata and chat| DB
            DB -->|Pre-backup hook: pg_dump| Dump
        end
        subgraph BackupNS["Namespace: velero"]
            Trigger["Manual backup or hourly schedule"]
            Velero["Velero server<br/>GCP plugin"]
            Agent["Velero node-agent<br/>Kopia file system backup"]
            Trigger --> Velero
            Velero -->|Coordinate volume backups| Agent
        end
        K8s["Kubernetes API<br/>Deployments, Services, Secrets, PVC specs"]
        K8s -->|Resource definitions| Velero
        Docs -->|File contents| Agent
        Dump -->|Dump file| Agent
    end

    GCS[("Google Cloud Storage<br/>Outside the cluster<br/>Resources + both volume backups")]
    User -->|Local kubectl port-forward| App
    App -.->|Optional generated answers| Model
    Velero -->|Kubernetes resource backup| GCS
    Agent -->|Volume data backup| GCS

